<mjml>
<!--
  IMPECCABLE DIRECTION CONTRACT
  THESIS: v1 of this template made a wrong call — plain white, no product
  list, reasoning that a frequent operational email shouldn't compete for
  urgency. Corrected on user review: a new order is revenue, arguably the
  single most consequential event in a distributor's inbox, and under-
  signalling that relative to every other email in this set (all colored)
  was backwards. v2: Cobalt-light band, same token and "positive, settled,
  this matters" reasoning as order-confirmed.mjml — and the actual product
  list, not just a count, because triaging a new order ("do I have stock,
  is this a rush job, anything unusual") needs to know what was ordered,
  not just how much it added up to. Still no floated identity circle — the
  only uploaded-logo asset type in this system is `distributor-logo`;
  there's no "other party" (the customer) logo to show, so that technique
  still doesn't apply to this audience.
  OWN-WORLD: apps/portal/DESIGN.md, inherited exactly — same header/
  distributor-footer chrome, hard 0px corners, Cobalt reserved for the one
  CTA, Inter, the label/bold-value line pattern from order-received.mjml/
  order-confirmed.mjml ("Order number: **ORD-1042**"). The product list
  below the hero uses a hairline `#E6ECF2` border between rows — DESIGN.md's
  own separator language ("Borders... are the system's primary way of
  separating surfaces"), not a new pattern invented for this list.
  Deliberately NOT truncated regardless of order size — the whole point of
  this revision is showing more, not less.
  STORY: whoever opens this on the distributor's side knows immediately
  whether this order needs urgent handling (value, requested delivery date,
  PO reference, and now every product ordered) without opening the admin
  app first.
  FIRST VIEWPORT: header, one Cobalt-light hero — "New order" headline, the
  customer+order-number sentence, a compact fact list (total, requested
  delivery, PO reference — each line only appears if that data exists),
  "Review order" — then a white section listing every product ordered,
  then the distributor-footer.
  FORM: extends the established world onto a new (Operate-mode) audience;
  direction was already set by the customer-email pass.
  FINISH: verified via a real MJML render/screenshot (both a short and a
  long order) + a real MailHog send.
-->
<mj-head>
  <mj-title>New order from {{customerName}}</mj-title>
  <mj-font name="Inter" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
  <mj-attributes>
    <mj-text font-size="14px" font-weight="400" line-height="1.5" color="#0B1D3A" padding="0" />
  </mj-attributes>
</mj-head>
<mj-body background-color="#F2F4F7" width="480px">

  {{> header}}

  <mj-section background-color="#E6EEFF" padding="32px 32px 0" border-left="1px solid #E6ECF2" border-right="1px solid #E6ECF2">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text font-size="24px" font-weight="600" line-height="1.3" color="#0B1D3A" padding-bottom="16px">
        New order
      </mj-text>
      <mj-text color="#0B1D3A" padding-bottom="20px">
        <strong>{{customerName}}</strong> placed order <strong>{{orderNumber}}</strong>.
      </mj-text>
      {{#if orderTotalFormatted}}
      <mj-text padding-bottom="4px">
        <span style="color:#5B6B7F;">Order total:</span> <strong style="color:#0B1D3A;">{{orderTotalFormatted}}</strong>
      </mj-text>
      {{/if}}
      {{#if requestedDeliveryDateFormatted}}
      <mj-text padding-bottom="4px">
        <span style="color:#5B6B7F;">Requested delivery:</span> <strong style="color:#0B1D3A;">{{requestedDeliveryDateFormatted}}</strong>
      </mj-text>
      {{/if}}
      {{#if customerReference}}
      <mj-text padding-bottom="4px">
        <span style="color:#5B6B7F;">PO reference:</span> <strong style="color:#0B1D3A;">{{customerReference}}</strong>
      </mj-text>
      {{/if}}
      <mj-button href="{{orderUrl}}" background-color="#1565FF" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="15px"
        font-weight="600" border-radius="0" padding="24px 0 32px" inner-padding="14px 32px" align="center">
        Review order
      </mj-button>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>

  {{#if hasOrderLines}}
  <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="24px 32px 0" border-left="1px solid #E6ECF2" border-right="1px solid #E6ECF2">
    <mj-column>
      <mj-text padding-bottom="4px" font-weight="600" font-size="14px">
        Items ({{lineItemCount}})
      </mj-text>
      <mj-text padding-bottom="0">
        {{orderLinesHtml}}
      </mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  {{/if}}

  {{> distributor-footer}}

</mj-body>
</mjml>
